</style>
<h2>Asobi 0.9 (build 796)</h2>
<ul>
<li><b>The filmstrip comes back.</b> G toggles it as ever; a strip that had been dragged upward in a taller window was landing above the top edge of a smaller one, where it could not be seen. One that would land outside the window now snaps back to its home above the control panel.</li>
<li><b>Reopening a live review from the Review Manager brings the whole share back</b> &#8212; the link, the passphrase to read out, the personal links and the share itself &#8212; not just the room. Before, the panel showed a bare room with no passphrase and &#8220;Start Web Share&#8221; over a share that was still live.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
